L0@P0: 2026 GENERAL ELECTION UMOVA NOTICE
L1@P0: Official Notice of Election for Military and Overseas Voters
L2@P0: County of NORTHAMPTON
L3@P0: 2026 General Election (November 3, 2026)
L4@P0: This is an official notice of a General Primary Election to be conducted on 11/3/2026 in Northampton County.
L5@P0: You may register to vote and request an official absentee ballot by using the Federal Postcard Application
L6@P0: (FPCA), available at www.vote.pa.gov or www.fvap.gov. You may apply for an absentee ballot by submitting
L7@P0: your FPCA by fax to (610) 559-3736 or by email to elections@northamptoncounty.org
L8@P0: You may request an absentee ballot from this office at any time prior to a primary or election. However, if time
L9@P0: does not permit you to receive and return an official absentee ballot, you are also entitled to vote using the
L10@P0: Federal Write-in Absentee Ballot (FWAB). Military electors may also use the FWAB to register to vote and vote
L11@P0: simultaneously.
L12@P0: You may use the FWAB to vote for all federal, state, and local offices, and ballot initiatives.
L13@P0: To vote, fill out and send in the Voter Information Page (page 2) and Official Backup Ballot (page 3) of the
L14@P0: FWAB.
L15@P0: To vote for offices or for ballot initiatives, write the names of candidates or ballot initiatives in the appropriate
L16@P0: section of the FWAB. Under the Federal Offices heading, enter the name and political party of the federal
L17@P0: candidate you choose. Under the Other Offices heading, enter the state or local office, name of candidate,
L18@P0: and political party of the candidate you choose. Under the Ballot Initiative or other items heading, enter the
L19@P0: title of the ballot initiative (referendum) you are voting on and write “yes” or “no.”
L20@P0: NOTE: The official list of candidates for nomination to public offices and election to party offices may be
L21@P0: updated due to candidate withdrawals and litigation. This notice will be updated as the official list of candidates
L22@P0: is being finalized.
